<PageTitle>Implementation Plan - OperationsFlow</PageTitle>

<PageHero Eyebrow="OPERATIONSFLOW / ROADMAP"
          Title="Implementation Plan"
          Subtitle="The implementation plan separates the local production foundation from the full Microsoft 365 production layer. Week 3 proves the evidence workflow locally. Week 4 replaces local proof with SharePoint storage, Entra authentication, permissions, and deployment readiness."
          BadgeText="Week 3 Final Pass"
          BadgeClass="of-badge of-badge-success">
    <Actions>
        <a class="of-btn of-btn-secondary" href="/technical-overview">Technical Overview</a>
        <a class="of-btn of-btn-secondary" href="/integration-overview">Integration Overview</a>
        <a class="of-btn of-btn-secondary" href="/prototype-scope">Prototype Scope</a>
        <a class="of-btn of-btn-primary" href="/user-roles">User Roles</a>
    </Actions>
</PageHero>

<PurposeNote Title="Purpose" Icon="🗺️">
    <p>
        This page explains where OperationsFlow is now, what Week 3 completed, and how Week 4 should be implemented without throwing away the local workflow foundation.
    </p>
</PurposeNote>

<MetricGrid>
    <MetricCard Title="Week 1"
                Value="Complete"
                Detail="MVP workflow shape, dashboard, seeded data, and core module layout."
