<div class="of-two-column-grid">
    <InfoPanel Title="Week 3 completed foundation"
               Subtitle="The local workflow now proves the business system loop end-to-end."
               Tone="success">

        <ul class="of-mini-list">
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Persistence:</strong><span>SQLite persistence and local migrations.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Traceability:</strong><span>ActivityLogs table and evidence activity trail.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Metadata:</strong><span>DocumentAttachment model/service/storage layer.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Storage:</strong><span>Local file provider under wwwroot/uploads.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Library:</strong><span>Document Library for files across modules.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Component:</strong><span>Reusable RecordAttachments component.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Work Orders:</strong><span>Record attachment panel and file counts.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Corrective Actions:</strong><span>Record attachment panel and file counts.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Document Intake:</strong><span>Details page, attachments, file counts, and library connection.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Data Quality:</strong><span>Missing evidence checks for important records.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Reports:</strong><span>Evidence coverage and missing evidence report sections.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Portfolio docs:</strong><span>Reviewer, demo, and business value pages updated.</span></li>
        </ul>
    </InfoPanel>

    <InfoPanel Title="Week 4 production target"
               Subtitle="The next sprint should add real production integration and permission boundaries."
               Tone="warning">

        <ul class="of-mini-list">
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Authentication:</strong><span>Microsoft Entra ID login.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Authorization:</strong><span>Role and permission enforcement.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Storage:</strong><span>SharePoint file storage provider via Microsoft Graph.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Configuration:</strong><span>Tenant id, client id, site id, drive/library id, and provider settings.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Provider swap:</strong><span>Upload/download/delete mapping to SharePoint behaviour.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Roles:</strong><span>Admin, Manager, Reviewer, Worker, and ReadOnly policy model.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Deployment:</strong><span>Local/test/production environment notes.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Governance:</strong><span>Audit, backup, retention, and support expectations.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Automation:</strong><span>Optional Power Automate notifications.</span></li>
            <li class="of-mini-list-item"><strong>Reporting:</strong><span>Optional Power BI production reporting path.</span></li>
        </ul>
    </InfoPanel>
</div>

<InfoPanel Title="Week 4 implementation order"
           Subtitle="This order keeps Week 4 focused on production hardening instead of random new pages."
           Tone="default">

    <div class="of-review-proof-grid">
        <div class="of-review-proof-card">
            <span class="of-badge of-badge-info">Step 1</span>
            <h3>Configuration foundation</h3>
            <p>Add appsettings structure for storage provider, Graph/SharePoint settings, auth settings, and environment boundaries.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="of-review-proof-card">
            <span class="of-badge of-badge-warning">Step 2</span>
            <h3>Authentication foundation</h3>
            <p>Add Microsoft Entra ID authentication and safe local development fallback rules if needed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="of-review-proof-card">
            <span class="of-badge of-badge-success">Step 3</span>
            <h3>Role policy foundation</h3>
            <p>Implement Admin, Manager, Reviewer, Worker, and ReadOnly policies without overcomplicating the UI.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="of-review-proof-card">
            <span class="of-badge of-badge-info">Step 4</span>
            <h3>SharePoint storage provider</h3>
            <p>Implement the provider behind the existing file storage abstraction using Microsoft Graph.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="of-review-proof-card">
            <span class="of-badge of-badge-muted">Step 5</span>
            <h3>Provider swap testing</h3>
            <p>Upload evidence from Work Orders, Corrective Actions, and Document Intake without rebuilding those pages.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="of-review-proof-card">
            <span class="of-badge of-badge-warning">Step 6</span>
            <h3>Production readiness docs</h3>
            <p>Document tenant setup, app registration, permission scopes, site/library setup, folder convention, and deployment boundaries.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="of-review-proof-card">
            <span class="of-badge of-badge-success">Step 7</span>
            <h3>Final release packaging</h3>
            <p>Update README, screenshots, test checklist, release notes, known limitations, and portfolio walkthrough path.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</InfoPanel>

<InfoPanel Title="Critical implementation rule"
           Subtitle="Week 4 should keep the Week 3 business workflow and replace the infrastructure underneath it."
           Tone="success">

    <div class="of-link-row">
        <span class="of-badge of-badge-info">Record details</span>
        <span>→</span>
        <span class="of-badge of-badge-success">Upload evidence</span>
        <span>→</span>
        <span class="of-badge of-badge-warning">Document Library</span>
        <span>→</span>
        <span class="of-badge of-badge-danger">Data Quality</span>
        <span>→</span>
        <span class="of-badge of-badge-info">Reports</span>
        <span>→</span>
        <span class="of-badge of-badge-muted">Activity Log</span>
    </div>

    <p class="of-muted-text">
        Work Orders, Corrective Actions, Document Intake, Document Library, Data Quality, Reports, and Activity Log should not be rebuilt for SharePoint.
        The production implementation should replace the provider behind that workflow, then add real authentication, authorization, storage configuration, and deployment readiness.
    </p>
</InfoPanel>

<GuidanceNote Title="Current sprint decision" Icon="🏁" Tone="info">
    <p>
        Finish Week 3 with storage readiness, role readiness, documentation, release notes, screenshots, and clean Git status before starting Week 4.
    </p>
</GuidanceNote>